meta {
  name: Negative API Testing
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  Error-handling and authorisation coverage: invalid field types, missing
  required fields, malformed JSON, bad credentials, and mutations without a
  valid token. A setup request creates a dedicated fixture booking so the
  invalid-token tests target a booking that is guaranteed to exist, keeping
  this folder independent of the positive suite and of seeded data.
}
